  "faith": "OpenStreetMap contributors via Overpass, retrieved 2026-08-03, ODbL. Named places of worship whose point falls inside the boundary, plus places this project holds itself where OSM does not tag them as places of worship. 508 unnamed OSM points are not counted. Denomination is not published; see DECISIONS D25.",
  "acsDirect": "US Census Bureau ACS 5-year 2024, api.census.gov, retrieved 2026-08-03. medianIncome and medianRent are TRUE POOLED MEDIANS: household counts from B19001 and B25063 were summed across each neighborhood's whole tracts and the median interpolated inside the containing bracket, which is the Census Bureau's own method. They are not averages of tract medians, which cannot be averaged. Youth from B01001, child poverty from B17001, 16-19 not in school and not working from B14005. Tract-to-neighborhood assignment reproduces the existing tract counts for all 17 neighborhoods exactly, and total population matches the previous file to 0.00%."
